# Range-separated hybrid (full- and short-range exact exchange) in the
# complex basis, restricted; the energy equals erkale's.
System N2.xyz
Basis cc-pVDZ
Method hyb_gga_xc_wb97x
Multiplicity 1
Restricted true
ComplexBasis true
JKMethod Cholesky
DFTGrid 75 -302
# The converged orbital gradient lands near 1e-8 (7.8e-9 typically),
# and some runs do not get below; the energy is checked to 1e-7 or less
ConvThr 1e-7
SaveChk complex_orbs_n2_wb97x.chk
